# discord-rs

Create discord bots using rust. With a feature-rich, and async ready API
wrapper for Discord.

## Features

- Handles heavy multi-guild bots with effeciency 
- Proper rate limit handling

## Getting Started

Want to start right away? Head to our QuickStart section.

